{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まにだよ？ Rottyだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日おつかれさまでしたぁぁ（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村真夏。ぁ,,,？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違うね。真洋と真夏です.＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/23/3723069/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/23/3723069/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！ということで昨日は,京都にて握手会＋ミニライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアは写真の通り,真夏と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏産まれペアですね（＾ω＾）わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏推しの皆さん,Rotty夢の皆さん,今回も本当にありがとうございましたあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆優しい～  だいすきぃぃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まにまに～？ずっきゅゅゅゅーん』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぇ？無理あるかなあ？けけけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まにまに～？  フラァァァーシュ✨！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちの方がいいかな。笑☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（西武ドーム LIVE終了後）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/23/3723069/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ。 雑誌『EX大衆』に乃木團コーナーあったんだけど見てくれてたかなあ（＾ω＾）？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てない方も是非チェックしてみてねん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会が終わって、昨晩は『乃木坂46SHOW!』のOA日でしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「命は美しい」と乃木團バンドやりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OA終了後、755などで沢山のヤジコメをしてくれました！本当にありがとう❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの後、『乃木團』がTwitterのトレンドに入ってたみたいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいです！ てんきゅ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと私。まあや可愛い～可愛い～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/23/3723069/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のチェキ会もありがとうごさいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、ことこ、七瀬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/03/23/3723069/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会が終わった後は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬とご飯に行ってきました（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこ行ったんだっけなぁぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？ お店の名前が思い出せない。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず七瀬が好きなお店に行ったぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、そろそろいい時間ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジティブ！ポジティブ！だよ！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も楽しく頑張ろうね～(*^◯^*)✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねん。"}],"source":"archive"}